# Implementation plan — Spec 1.10.1

## Summary

Add **`ListFilterPanel`** and **`ListFilterTrigger`** to `@webonone/ui-kit`, demo on Components showcase, roll out to all in-scope list pages (Email, WebOnOne, Media), and add **`list-filter-panel.mdc`**. See [02-ui-kit-list-filter-panel.md](./02-ui-kit-list-filter-panel.md), [03-service-filter-rollout.md](./03-service-filter-rollout.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.10.1` |
| Package builds | `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` before consumer prod builds |

---

## Phase 1 — UI Kit components

**Goal:** Slide-over filter panel + header trigger.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| `ListFilterPanel` | `ui-kit/package/src/components/ListFilterPanel.tsx` |
| `ListFilterTrigger` | same file or sibling |
| Export | `ui-kit/package/src/index.ts` |

**Exit criteria:** Panel slides from right; overlay + Escape close; Apply/Clear footer.

**Verify:** `npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit` · `npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root`

