## Risks and open items

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Queue tabs vs panel | Move status into panel; remove tab row for consistency |
| Mobile panel width | Full-width panel on small screens (`max-w-sm` on `sm+`) |
| Media API lacks search param | Client-filter current page slice; document limitation |

---

## Final verification

```bash
npm run build -w @webonone/ui-kit
npm run type-check -w ui-kit-root
npm run type-check -w email-root
npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root
npm run type-check -w media-root
```

