## Constraints

- Use `FeaturePage` `actions` for `ListFilterTrigger` — not ad-hoc header rows.
- Reset pagination to page 1 on filter apply ([item-list-pagination.mdc](../../.cursor/rules/item-list-pagination.mdc)).
- Do not add inline full-width filter forms above lists.
